admin-error-invalid-auction-intake = Enter a valid equipment URL, positive integer start price, and player ID.
admin-error-unsupported-equipment-source = The equipment URL or page content did not pass validation. Use an equip link on hentaiverse.org with an equipment ID and 10-character hexadecimal key. If the page opens but the equipment is Soulbound, check the equipment_source.require_tradeable switch in runtime configuration.
admin-error-equipment-source-unavailable = The equipment page cannot be read right now. Confirm that the equipment source is configured and Credential Management has a valid MM Cookie for this world; if both are correct, wait briefly and try again.
admin-error-auction-intake-unavailable = This world has no draft accepting items. Create a draft that can accept items, then submit again.
admin-error-auction-intake-player-blacklisted = This player cannot submit auction items. Review the blacklist in User Management, then remove the restriction or choose an eligible seller.
admin-error-equipment-conflict = This equipment has already been submitted. Find the existing lot instead of submitting it again.
admin-error-request-timeout = The request timed out and the server result may not have returned yet. The form is preserved; submit again from this page. The same command will not create a duplicate.

