admin-runtime-op-note-economics = Applies to new auctions only. Starting prices must be multiples of 1K and at most 1B. 50000 PPM means 5%; 0 uses the existing fixed minimum increment.
admin-runtime-op-note-schedule = Local times must follow Monday-to-Sunday order. Preview must start at least 2 hours before opening, and closing must be later. Existing auction times stay frozen.
admin-runtime-op-note-forum = Configure forum credentials before enabling synchronization. Task timeouts must cover pagination and posting requests and remain shorter than the lease.
admin-runtime-op-note-alerts = Set a recipient and enable the corresponding mail world. Cooldown must cover the grouping window; the lease must be at least 4 times the health source timeout.
admin-runtime-op-note-worker = Concurrency must not exceed the batch limit. Lifecycle, fulfillment and recovery timeouts must be shorter than their leases. Delivery renews its lease.
