admin-runtime-op-mail-intervals-note = Minimum time between starts of two sends in the same group, shared across Main and Isekai. All defaults are 0 seconds (no added wait); account serialization, remote rate limits and Sent verification still apply. Outbid notices wake the queue on commit and take priority without interrupting in-flight work. Save, then restart Worker to apply. Taking or returning existing mail is unaffected.
