admin-runtime-op-mail-interval-operations = Operations alerts (seconds)
admin-runtime-op-mail-interval-manual = Manual mail (seconds)
admin-runtime-op-note-mail = Applies after restarting Worker. Changing the schedule affects future scheduling; existing due times, cursors and leases remain authoritative. The endpoint, credentials, mailbox identity and global mail enable switch stay in deployment configuration. Fetch and processing timeouts must exceed the HTTP timeout; renewal must be shorter than the lease.
